    "name": "Gainsight PX REST Segment Match Event API",
    "description": "Gainsight PX API provides a programmatic (server-based) method to access the users, accounts, and events that have been captured by the Gainsight PX subscription.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Gainsight PX\n Email: pxsupport@gainsight.com",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T20:31:26.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-21T20:31:27.000Z",
